    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/635f72091be651aede4705c60c3ff7a9.avif?t=1722333712\" /></div><br><br>In Rules: Politically Incorrect you get to become the President.<br>Take on ruling a modern democracy with just one finger.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/2ddafd2228be65881f8dbfa19b024039.poster.avif?t=1722333712\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/2ddafd2228be65881f8dbfa19b024039.webm?t=1722333712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/2ddafd2228be65881f8dbfa19b024039.mp4?t=1722333712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Being in charge is about making people happy.<br>All of them. All the time.<br><br>Balance between Authority, Equality, Progressiveness and your Budget <br>as long as possible. Become the kind of leader you actually are.<br>Only God can judge you.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/de96bfa20329809e7322e40221d0d267.poster.avif?t=1722333712\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/de96bfa20329809e7322e40221d0d267.webm?t=1722333712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/de96bfa20329809e7322e40221d0d267.mp4?t=1722333712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/ff7d5844ec27aabb586f931f16940787.poster.avif?t=1722333712\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/ff7d5844ec27aabb586f931f16940787.webm?t=1722333712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/ff7d5844ec27aabb586f931f16940787.mp4?t=1722333712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Modern democracy is about a lot of things: <br>freedom, equality, justice and inclusivity.<br><br>But sometimes its also about banning white toilet paper,<br>legalizing machine guns for kids or creating a revolt in<br>a neighbor country for oil.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/444e5ec808cbb5cc12a80177268f6676.poster.avif?t=1722333712\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/444e5ec808cbb5cc12a80177268f6676.webm?t=1722333712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/444e5ec808cbb5cc12a80177268f6676.mp4?t=1722333712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You can\u2019t become all powerful without some aids.<br>Since you get to come back from the underworld a lot.<br>You get to play with the Only Ring, Ark of Covenant.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/a16244642320b9fb94190e58cf1df11f.poster.avif?t=1722333712\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/a16244642320b9fb94190e58cf1df11f.webm?t=1722333712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/a16244642320b9fb94190e58cf1df11f.mp4?t=1722333712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>A man is judged by how his endings, not beginnings.<br>Explore more than 1200 events filled with edgy humor<br>and in style. Each play through is going to be different<br>meaning there is a chance you might just finish the game<br>and break the ancient Indian curse!<br><br>Share your insights with us on our Discord channel.<br>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/635f72091be651aede4705c60c3ff7a9.avif?t=1722333712\" /></div><br><br>In Rules: Politically Incorrect you get to become the President.<br>Take on ruling a modern democracy with just one finger.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/2ddafd2228be65881f8dbfa19b024039.poster.avif?t=1722333712\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/2ddafd2228be65881f8dbfa19b024039.webm?t=1722333712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/2ddafd2228be65881f8dbfa19b024039.mp4?t=1722333712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Being in charge is about making people happy.<br>All of them. All the time.<br><br>Balance between Authority, Equality, Progressiveness and your Budget <br>as long as possible. Become the kind of leader you actually are.<br>Only God can judge you.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/de96bfa20329809e7322e40221d0d267.poster.avif?t=1722333712\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/de96bfa20329809e7322e40221d0d267.webm?t=1722333712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/de96bfa20329809e7322e40221d0d267.mp4?t=1722333712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/ff7d5844ec27aabb586f931f16940787.poster.avif?t=1722333712\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/ff7d5844ec27aabb586f931f16940787.webm?t=1722333712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/ff7d5844ec27aabb586f931f16940787.mp4?t=1722333712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Modern democracy is about a lot of things: <br>freedom, equality, justice and inclusivity.<br><br>But sometimes its also about banning white toilet paper,<br>legalizing machine guns for kids or creating a revolt in<br>a neighbor country for oil.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/444e5ec808cbb5cc12a80177268f6676.poster.avif?t=1722333712\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/444e5ec808cbb5cc12a80177268f6676.webm?t=1722333712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/444e5ec808cbb5cc12a80177268f6676.mp4?t=1722333712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You can\u2019t become all powerful without some aids.<br>Since you get to come back from the underworld a lot.<br>You get to play with the Only Ring, Ark of Covenant.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/a16244642320b9fb94190e58cf1df11f.poster.avif?t=1722333712\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/a16244642320b9fb94190e58cf1df11f.webm?t=1722333712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1628170/extras/a16244642320b9fb94190e58cf1df11f.mp4?t=1722333712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>A man is judged by how his endings, not beginnings.<br>Explore more than 1200 events filled with edgy humor<br>and in style. Each play through is going to be different<br>meaning there is a chance you might just finish the game<br>and break the ancient Indian curse!<br><br>Share your insights with us on our Discord channel.<br>",
